  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ul>
      <li>para
- li</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
[r][] [^p] [^c]
[^c]: - para
   # H
.
<p>[r][] [^p] <a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <ul>
        <li>para</li>
      </ul>
      <h1 id="H">H</h1>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

