```
- :: term
  : body
  +
  before
   > nested
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>body</dd>
    </dl>
    before
    <blockquote><p>nested</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

